# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary>
#
# Why:
# - Explain the reason for the change.
#
# Changes:
# - Summarize the main changes.
#
# Validation:
# - State what was checked, or write "Not run" with a reason.
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, ci, build, perf, revert.
# Use English, lowercase type and scope, and a title of at most 72 characters.
